# Line-ending policy. Files that EXECUTE on the Linux Raspberry Pis must keep LF endings even
# when the repo is checked out on the Windows controller — bash and systemd choke on CRLF
# ("$'\r': command not found", "syntax error: unexpected end of file"). This overrides a
# Windows git core.autocrlf=true, so Deploy scp's LF scripts to the Pis.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
